# SatQuery AI — LangGraph Agentic Orchestration Layer

## Context & Alignment with Tech Stack

Per the project technology stack:
* **Orchestration Framework**: **LangGraph** (`StateGraph`, conditional edges, stateful multi-agent flow)
* **Deep Learning & Vision-Language**: **PyTorch**, **Transformers**, **PEFT** (BLIP-2 QLoRA models 1, 2, 3)
* **Geospatial Processing**: **Rasterio**, **PIL**, **OpenCV**
* **Future Layers**: **FastAPI** (REST backend), **PostgreSQL** (metadata & session store), **ReactJS + Leaflet** (geospatial web UI)

This task implements the **LangGraph-native Agentic Orchestration Layer**, completely decoupled from any UI, ready to be served by FastAPI or run standalone.

---

## 1. LangGraph State Machine Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    Start([__start__]) --> RouterNode[Router Node<br/>Intent & Modality Classifier]
    
    RouterNode -->|route == 'vqa'| VQANode[VQA Node<br/>Model 1 + Attention Grounding]
    RouterNode -->|route == 'crossmodal'| CrossModalNode[Cross-Modal Node<br/>Model 2 + Dual-Stream Grounding]
    RouterNode -->|route == 'change_detect'| ChangeNode[Change Detection Node<br/>Model 3 + Radiometric Mask & BBoxes]
    RouterNode -->|route == 'geospatial_qa'| KnowledgeNode[Geospatial Knowledge Node<br/>Domain Theory & Satellite Specs]

    VQANode --> EvidenceNode[Evidence Grounding Node<br/>Spatial Attribution & Artifacts]
    CrossModalNode --> EvidenceNode
    ChangeNode --> EvidenceNode
    KnowledgeNode --> SynthesizerNode

    EvidenceNode --> SynthesizerNode[Synthesizer Node<br/>Final Response Formulation]
    SynthesizerNode --> EndNode([__end__])
```

